id: 1198000
event: msg
data: {"sid":"04a23c5d-d305-4388-9869-a2a957c00c6f","m":{"id":"4d85b7c7-d7e4-40ac-8995-70fc675c9b34","role":"assistant","kind":"text","text":"The easiest way is through the real ad, so you see exactly what customers see:\n\n1. On your iPhone, tap this preview link for the Beginner friendly ad: https://fb.me/1WgWLnY2UHQ6Ih0. It should load the ad in the Facebook app.\n2. Tap **Learn more** on the ad. The quiz loads inside Facebook's own browser, with Facebook's bar on the screen.\n3. Go through the quiz. Use an email like `me+fbtest@eugenechantk.me`, so I can leave your test out of the numbers.\n4. On the price screen, tap the **Apple Pay** button.\n5. Check whether the Apple Pay sheet slides up. Then tap Cancel. Do not confirm with Face ID, because that would start a real free trial.\n\nIf the link loads in Safari instead of Facebook, the test doesn't count. In that case, make a Facebook post set to \"Only me\" with `fiftystrong.app/quiz` in it, and tap the link in the post.\n\nThe preview costs nothing. The campaign has hit its cap, so nothing is spending.\n\nTell me what happens when you tap Apple Pay: does the sheet appear, or does nothing happen?","ts":1792138872225}}

: hb 1198000

